  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d27574321cbb817a13bcd41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态感觉很好哦！\r\n感觉可以全力用自己的跑法去跑呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b2f18084cab377bb6b16150be7138c15d3bede5f8af665dfef721a55b68a3c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f15b3f50c8cc2aebdef9c914",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就快要比赛了呢──！\r\n不知道会有哪些对手呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "27f2db5893dc0f9ae4728bc26cab6d24bfe6e498d73c174efbbc919c9152d972",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1de3c654c5e0a03a2bc0617e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，\r\n比赛前都会觉得很期待呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14098362e27c1acb7fc34e48a911af9883c236220b657934a0e4ec5c50ef3380",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bc195ddd37d35d7fa23616f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有没有什么忘记准备的？\r\n诶嘿，因为我很常忘东忘西的，\r\n就麻烦训练员确认咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "417eb6304508b4d5f27d4e357cd2caf0b51ee6279569de84ce3ed4a242e85669",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b48465476c04b77a438b543",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔～身体好痒啊～！\r\n好紧张啊──！\r\n但我的斗志也燃、烧、啦──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5169355a13c1397d44dcb3ffa053eb164d9d7a2c8afdf1352f3336b1842a6e28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e1e8a4ecf9eba787aa6558d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔唔……这样下去不行！\r\n要拿出气势才行！\r\n喔喔喔喔喔！喔喔喔喔喔喔喔！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75605a6eeb401c67db02847a4df47b0c5d7bab4ed7ff577528812d6eccb1bebd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1cf12c6ed89a6a77b1e7c3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然还有很多不放心的部分，\r\n但我的身边还有训练员在嘛，\r\n不──怕、不──怕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c619180c834dd4c5644873a570a561266a3ba1f06a7ed23d6e1df4b8e5fb4619",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cb4ebf71e90d19915f8e251",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果我输了……\r\n啊──怎么可以有这种想法……\r\n唔唔，可是……啊啊，我好没自信啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d47971ef8e4d8f9e6e206aff670b56c01660777942fa9573d87a5929d0e6cd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5e695872d9908bd957938ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "深、深呼吸好了！！\r\n嘶、嘶～嘶～～～\r\n唔……好、好痛苦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7f7d341c30de0a7a71aa70768cff3723e50c78ea6eb00163d23e63afab9f0e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0b99e481ba7b6f83b36a1f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……大家都绷紧神经的感觉……\r\n唔啊～身体好痒啊～\r\n但还是要拿出气势才行～唔唔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1869c7a52a0114601a2f3cc55fbbb9bbb25d2747212a4ab598fc9fdc3e0ae460",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e94d0b88e7a179f75be453fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "了～解！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e54952f7e689d1de159ba3588bfe37b68fde628c3f2ec64b07e2dac5002320d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dccd04169c4317dda27fc2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "知道了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9afeecaf9d8d2dc191e807f43cf94ef42f53160a8fbd7b6874467cebcd375a68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5871198c22bfd79223ffe33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要上了──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce7ab25ec16c51857a45e33413c8d0b541783b79fc49edfc207c167dd6580e92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cfc46b4a5cde06291ed46a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学习啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d439471f15225379113ab65b7e48fb60d73de0e3271f3a77cc4e0356b071aa8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26b4e841fb2028536c020a30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ffd86181f99bb201430319f3ea81b2a0a385cf1b40520738cae2644fb61703d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb61f95c9d7408e1a9a3db0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "495c65db6d547586561c7a4c398f17e43ebb21d8b2ddb8fb465a08829aebdbf4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e741bc97b11b774a8d7499d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92ae3e5dcae9a53056d19b3106de1996e8c400c410dfd1c96cb651012cfebc4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1614e21b851c2111fdfe8139",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是海啊──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dc4bc075480521095e50998f7b9926b2e626e42925427db8875813d2dc468a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bef526cbfda1fdfce611e6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我们一起努力的成果呢！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "520d68331df5692614832286aa562836dc69b69bf331f2d0eb6d2ae4f5e363a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7769533a38b0a373147c84a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，真的很谢谢你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b130c59c4caa0eff6621e625fd933a0072508ad010070c1875e1a309f16fa47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3eca7ac3b641957da98602ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "燃烧了，我的斗志燃烧了──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "724ce6b6fda25de661fea44539aedda6030c138c6f22a87b16089ff058520934",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee9e4687826a0a8a6f67b070",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "干劲十足！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3cc5b5a9f023e2dd01c5f1ed22c7e5c6939912eede67de84d4fb3125ef888a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40c60fbca6ca6d9eddcb9bcd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家加油吧──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15c459ed4a6ad33f7ee391ed679f4e8a051d90f616e9813eee7b9381772b6ff2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee9e061f19640e51ec971995",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，真的很谢谢你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b130c59c4caa0eff6621e625fd933a0072508ad010070c1875e1a309f16fa47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b64d41c8d61b4f34f54b3bff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉状态不错哦！\r\n我就像这样，全力以赴！\r\n跑起来就是这──样的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e41882a8d35fd6a76f196d36bcba9ca90e97c234de38407c433131110684b77e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d0587c4254814fa9e56f74d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活力满分！气势也十足！\r\n最后的直线我也会快速冲过哦──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4d407bab77145a6c0e7a2f1c9de29c420d442ae809f721707c410e148ee40a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f722889c3f38080e346eeb93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，真的很谢谢你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b130c59c4caa0eff6621e625fd933a0072508ad010070c1875e1a309f16fa47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83f652df2c64de506fc017f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やるぞー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f9ca76e3bbfd75f7f831b2eb4ee50d8ea1568e3b455245d0cc766d539e9bcaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01b1ef086fe91e9a3549ff73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，你有看着我跑吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cae3b671f98eab0adac259af5e9bc58ef68d1566952c536082512827e3aad35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc29bc4d242e7dcb308329e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿──！下次一定不会输的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f170a501c04d60e2d5f8b20e73a59db1bd20ad9f42a5d48ed067a7ab87ed41b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69246e514c7ded4f7f7775e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好──我要变得更快更快──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f47390dc6e0f827bf9ac9b9a9a9b22035797400a19d52e000b8109cd1c6bb356",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0842f7c735603428ffcf4d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜……呜……好不甘心喔喔喔！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7db921f94deb6c22c4b7d9c706ef1e783fe4ea962a801838339d034f2565dcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09592fb451f0c8458a8cba4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好了──！胜利胜利、大胜利！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03656abbcf5e1f7aa533ef71a78e337813825fb9b237fa83c8788d7b4c1b16bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0e55c6c1eb43461d58dca1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利的V字手势！耶──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "17039818180f0a6ad89fac61f0ade0ff484d96cc6bd83feffc2e68ebf6d580f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:011bb411885118f05d0af453",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为大家送上闪耀的梦想～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20bc9bc20948fd7c2a226db46d7045157a0d1d70653e6646aea84311fb58dd01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ede3e39697b9c48b8a83c52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利的手势！耶──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "455d03f430c096ac04d4f4d44adb959c636ef37375e88daafe42cd3387a5938e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df2be755337f839ac85f9d56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やったやったっ！宣言どぉーーりっ！！\r\nえへん！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b36d7fcd7c63047cd6a778e9ba21ac7f6f3ce8beac6094e75a25a6ae796b112c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "30206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:404a2a079bbe7049c5b2e812",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ぶいぶい！いぇーいっ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42e17e7b2db692f2869190d659d3add73f4330c8c18394169cce4d43209ca85c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "30207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13a5ad1a721b2d6a886b5a3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要上咯──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e40e842b92aa2f3f2d0e66d826e04e51f50d9f29ba0fa5f1eb1271dd3675958",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99d8a5adbd6009a999ae8fe2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为你带来！胜利的奖券！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59fd1a00f8b8d76793964f62d7bea14b15788a90e223f5222b18ca612d70b733",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4bc1d128363bff9a56df2fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一直很想当当看送货员～！\r\n为了送货到徒步无法抵达的地方，\r\n我还学了怎么开飞机喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b7447af3f2808294528ccc1d098f355be9c4cc2f3044a96535e67fde077dfa4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b8f228a0c523e86490af375",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "滑水梯好有趣的！\r\n不知道能不能滑得更快些啊──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8aee9585d8d6a1cf34858ead72c857e506c4b89be905b7a933cbdb1fcde02743",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6e6d4c45adfced6b4789963",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ユキちゃん…毎日すっごく全力だ！\r\n優しくて熱い思いが伝わってくる…\r\nうおおー！アタシも燃えてきたっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8ad25693fe96645ff917158532d5ad65d529c7c8f7c753c34d51f895a0e8f97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:257fbc55d94bb4ed79f4375e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜哇啊啊啊啊～～！呜呜……\r\n我想起了跟她一起进行的研究……\r\n真是太好了～～～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8867c08be59a2bf3027188ab50be4cbab002e7b17701cae9d2b746b3f171c0b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a45049f265a027679ac353e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为你带来！胜利的奖券！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59fd1a00f8b8d76793964f62d7bea14b15788a90e223f5222b18ca612d70b733",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15f998b9135a1af7b38be8c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动已经结束了吗！？\r\n好无聊啊──！呜哇！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a856720179fedd023aec24cf596c0502ead01b7ed63c1163f32b21607aa4986",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c62f93d8eb68dfbea96fa7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赢的人会是我！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ac01062faca1728ab5342827efbda56523b83597d32348bf1f9d7ec6dc843f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "40002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ce19946dfd518260837daf9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿！我把你的梦想送来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d60446fcc73ce8cb9eb507665212ba5f4713d73e121858cd22cc4352a62e53fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:883a0cab2cca41d4a63c27a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我送信到牧场时，\r\n看到长相很奇特的动物！\r\n它的身体像牛，头部像羊驼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9afe180322d1e6bd830d6ee5f4e1d8dd3222c2ca02e80dee062a4671c9b647ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "400030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:810ae62d69d149ae3b1761db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "遇上什么障碍我都不会停下脚步！\r\n一定要克服障碍！\r\n嘿嘿！我把你的梦想送来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc9091af27691a1248cce6c52d7b79e581c820e4b268577acee918653f0644bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bcac20f956c84703f4e55e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今日ね、和菓子屋さんの前通ったら\r\nお客さんがいっぱいだった！みんな\r\n笑顔でね！へへっ、うれしいなー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc24cac0ddb90459aeaa05263b375521416eeb7adb6115c1535b4467664cdeeb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "400073"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b79bff33d6e4eb67c0aab5b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝利を宣誓、だー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9396160eac9e251bf2131d3e75d94016f0d5d12d9346b3e99a207c2a3981e49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "40203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37991059ea4dc3e4a76e2ab6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宣誓！夢と、スポーツマンシップにのっとり\r\n正々堂々、勝利します！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9aa7dbee10b483c3b73c7eda8dd1427ef5c5b7b99838bc20fbf1847233e87cd5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "40204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d166563ac2ace9def962d6d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家一起炒热气氛吧──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca4e792fe3307bcab33fb8cf86bd2a50629eb881c71503a30920ee73c437261a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad39836e557493e04536a77d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔～心跳变好快啊──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b720cc82619fd4a51b6ef1ed27c4073d31d746d05e5c8803d6214b5f4ebab60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57f8323857e560c131ec1dbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和训练员一起前进啊啊啊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4167adf05c6cb76dab3acbaaf14427dcd0dbb5691f866bb3cfda612edc4f05ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffaafc1df67f937ab4963041",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我，一定要实现梦想！\r\n要和那天对着我发誓的训练员\r\n一起完成！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2961c9ab2767ba6ce2cd5b1847617fe97ac48c889128ee5bc6c0521aac254384",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4569053ce2da9d675b5c10e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哇！\r\n下摆开线了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c14d3bca3582dff12399ee0146c23cc1fccdb86e76dc1e8a62b46f94971d2a89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d126a4ddb5e1af3f560c2de8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样怎么样！？\r\n是不是有模有样的！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "74502c600a2784317495ebd6f9e74970e8c59ccfb00bd479753de3c0c14e5f39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6d452bbfe7da08e7ed1427a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "决胜服是我的伙伴！\r\n我要和它一起共创故事！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25a9b284f30cbe112bd74b51a75801a7f9d845c2ccd7541c7b19aec5e655ab65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ee5c6f45dd0803566bfdfe4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是勾到树枝了吗？\r\n会是我摔了一大跤那时勾到的吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9dd2b5938b3161b14f50ce1403190f2640bbb2f83c312c964a739c0f9c67c13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:309c5dc9adba06b73f0b46ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "热血的节奏、由此诞生的故事……！\r\n唔～！超棒的──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd33f6a04e6d6aef8302954cf01f81e18a29668d4453839271d3b05590cced93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd5f23c7ab8c6883b507c9c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也要在德比实现我的梦想！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5e2e62541af3d0ef5bd452de204d778d4ff3d21d3aa28cef2a7b8c804ab305c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33a379044672ea760060a334",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊！莫名地好想四处飞翔啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e7e3c34111f2fca3681750518db73ecf2afccb26b99286b60211ae46fc15f56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad3d39d4f0cf8682de226dce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想委托我去送货？OK～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01fa80ca07330473569e6dd70a4330aa114c71695eb5c67a2a50e71b5b1e211a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:742ca3953c6cfc3ebbc1f04f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感动了──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6407dcdb04d495e1a641c540905928718ec51545056d52cb5dcfca8c76a55a19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d473cc1242510f0780d1914",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽全力，取胜啊啊啊──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba8c2988b4c5e755fbb9a5213af5c21ff1a8c75e52345d9c1f6a71dfe2ea302e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48006ca710ed87b2894c5365",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "放假啦────！！训练员，\r\n我们去玩吧～～～～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1098138dc1eab39796e2839041b07845fb6c1c891e78a54f6397ce241898560a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f05d978db1cc35c5a4fedc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢这顶帽子！\r\n是爸爸买给我的！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6cc10d60f62d1c87fb65b72f9d4d9b73600ca4cdbe5358fe496e162da1f7d45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41ac32d163dc2e8025cef0e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "えへへ…。\r\nたまにはバチっと決めちゃうよー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4bf4d68ec1be443194ea6496f49d140e71902b2283b4c0797db02e48e8251e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "70216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18eb41e318ded1c45060e91d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "わっ！なになに？\r\nもしかしてリボン、曲がってる？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b08cdbbe09e58ff7276a34593eeb11d11bc03f2ffe72a07a24f84b759ee0f657",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
